@page "/features"
@layout LTSFrontend.Layout.PublicPageLayout

<PageTitle>Features - Litigation Tracking System</PageTitle>

<section class="public-page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Platform Features</span>
    <h1>Everything Your Firm Needs, In One Platform</h1>
    <p>
        From case intake to final judgment, the Litigation Tracking System brings every
        module a law firm relies on together &mdash; cases, hearings, documents, deadlines,
        reporting, and multi-tenant firm workspaces &mdash; in a single, secure system.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="public-page-body">

    <div class="public-section-title">
        <span class="eyebrow">Core Modules</span>
        <h2>Built Around the Full Litigation Lifecycle</h2>
        <p>Every module maps directly to how legal teams actually work, from registration to closure.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="public-feature-grid">
        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-briefcase"></i></div>
            <h3>Case Management</h3>
            <p>Register, track, and manage cases end-to-end with unique reference numbers.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Complete case profile &amp; party details</li>
                <li>Status &amp; stage tracking with full history</li>
                <li>Transfer, close, and re-open cases</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-calendar-event"></i></div>
            <h3>Hearing Management</h3>
            <p>Never miss a court date &mdash; schedule, reschedule, and record outcomes.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Upcoming &amp; overdue hearing views</li>
                <li>Judge, court room &amp; purpose tracking</li>
                <li>Automatic next-hearing linkage</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-alarm"></i></div>
            <h3>Deadline Management</h3>
            <p>Track filing deadlines and statutory timelines before they become a risk.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Configurable reminder windows</li>
                <li>Overdue &amp; completed deadline views</li>
                <li>Linked directly to each case</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-folder2-open"></i></div>
            <h3>Document Management</h3>
            <p>A centralized, version-controlled repository for every case document.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Version history &amp; document types</li>
                <li>Role-based view/download permissions</li>
                <li>Secure, access-controlled storage</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></div>
            <h3>User &amp; Firm Management</h3>
            <p>Multi-tenant workspaces with isolated data per law firm.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Firm workspace provisioning</li>
                <li>Role hierarchy: Admin to Intern</li>
                <li>Row-level security between firms</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i></div>
            <h3>Role-Based Access Control</h3>
            <p>Granular permissions so every role sees only what it should.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Super Admin to Intern hierarchy</li>
                <li>Conditional Moharrir access modes</li>
                <li>Enforced at every API endpoint</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-bell"></i></div>
            <h3>Notifications &amp; Alerts</h3>
            <p>Automated reminders for hearings, deadlines, and assignments.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Hearing &amp; deadline alerts</li>
                <li>Email &amp; in-app delivery</li>
                <li>Read / unread tracking</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i></div>
            <h3>Reports &amp; Dashboards</h3>
            <p>Real-time visibility into caseload, workload, and firm performance.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Role-specific dashboards</li>
                <li>Lawyer workload &amp; case statistics</li>
                <li>Exportable reports with date filters</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></div>
            <h3>Audit Trail</h3>
            <p>Every critical action is logged for full accountability.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>User, timestamp &amp; before/after values</li>
                <li>Login history &amp; session tracking</li>
                <li>Firm-scoped and system-wide logs</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-search"></i></div>
            <h3>Search &amp; Filters</h3>
            <p>Find any case, client, or document in seconds.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Search by case, client, lawyer, or court</li>
                <li>Filter by status, category &amp; date range</li>
                <li>Fast results even on large datasets</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i></div>
            <h3>Workflow &amp; Assignment</h3>
            <p>Assign cases to lawyers or external counsel with full accountability.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Legal Officer / Lawyer / External Counsel</li>
                <li>Lead counsel designation</li>
                <li>Transfer &amp; reassignment history</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="public-feature-card">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-journal-text"></i></div>
            <h3>Notes &amp; Milestones</h3>
            <p>Capture legal opinions, hearing orders, and key case milestones.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Private &amp; shared case notes</li>
                <li>Milestone tracking with completion status</li>
                <li>Full activity audit trail</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="public-cta-banner">
        <h2>See These Features in Action</h2>
        <p>Sign in to your firm's workspace, or reach out to learn more about onboarding your team.</p>
        <a href="/login" class="btn-gold">Go to Login</a>
    </div>

</section>
